# Crawling Sensation's ChangesZoneAll trigger reads FirstTime$ True
# (TriggerChangesZoneAll.java:33-40): it fires only when no land card
# entered a graveyard this turn outside the current batch. The first
# Thought Scour mills two Forests (an Insect); the second mills two more,
# but the earlier Forests are already in the graveyard this turn, so no
# second Insect.
# The upkeep "you may mill two" is declined.
queue confirmeffect false
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
queue targets human
queue cardorder 10,11
castspell human 4
resolvestack
resolvestack
tapformana human 3 U
queue targets human
queue cardorder 13,14
castspell human 5
resolvestack
